<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Dillard's said raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Dillard's said raised to buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities raised its rating of Dillard's Inc to buy from hold on Friday, according to a source at the brokerage.</p>
<p>-- Shares slipped 1/8 to 38-7/8.</p>
</text>
